ing patients between  regions to spread the pressure more  evenly  Paris's hospitals are now full and 38  critically ill coronavirus patients were  transferred by high-speed train to the  city of Rennes on Wednesday in Spain  where yet another record of 864 new  deaths were recorded in the previous 24  hours the temporary hospital created at  this Madrid conference center has been  restocked with fresh supplies every bed  can save a life and in this crisis every  minute matters  Paul Brennan al-jazeera
 

